sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP HTTP/HTTPS
    participant Detectors as Content Detectors<br/>(regex, PII, etc.)
    participant LLM as vLLM Runtime

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Non-Streaming Chat Completion with Detection

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer token<br/>{"stream": false, "messages": [...]}
    Gateway->>Gateway: Lookup route config<br/>Inject detector definitions
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Optional mTLS + Forwarded Auth<br/>{"detectors": {...}, "messages": [...]}
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run input detectors
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator->>LLM: Forward inference request
    LLM-->>Orchestrator: Generated response
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run output detectors
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator-->>Gateway: Response with detections[]
    Gateway->>Gateway: Check detections<br/>If triggered: substitute fallback message
    Gateway-->>Client: OpenAI-compatible JSON response

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completion (SSE)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer token<br/>{"stream": true, "messages": [...]}
    Gateway->>Gateway: Lookup route config<br/>Inject detector definitions
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Optional mTLS + Forwarded Auth<br/>{"stream": true, "detectors": {...}}
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run input detectors
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection results
    Orchestrator->>LLM: Forward streaming request

    loop SSE Chunks
        LLM-->>Orchestrator: SSE chunk
        Orchestrator->>Detectors: Per-chunk output detection
        Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection result
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: SSE chunk with detections
        Gateway->>Gateway: Parse chunk<br/>Apply fallback if detection triggered
        Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk (data: {...})
    end

    Gateway-->>Client: SSE: [DONE]

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 3: Detection Triggered (Fallback Response)

    Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>{"messages": [{"content": "PII data..."}]}
    Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST with injected detectors
    Orchestrator->>Detectors: Run detectors
    Detectors-->>Orchestrator: Detection TRIGGERED
    Orchestrator-->>Gateway: Response with non-empty detections[]
    Gateway->>Gateway: Detection found!<br/>Replace content with route fallback_message
    Gateway-->>Client: {"choices": [{"message": {"content": "fallback_message"}}]}
